&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Airtame:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A harder problem than a cloud shop&#39;s. Our real-time media has to hold up across a spread of devices in meeting rooms, on networks we don&#39;t control. Different constraints than a uniform server fleet, and more of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Room to set the bar. You&#39;d be the first deep specialist Airtame&#39;s had on conferencing quality, so how it&#39;s measured and judged is still open for you to shape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant responsibility and ownership over projects and your field of expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five weeks paid vacation and 5 days of extra paid AirtameFlex days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work environment, with a hybrid mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
